20:T622,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does this tool show room prices or availability?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It lists nearby hotels from map data. Call the hotel or use a booking site to confirm prices and availability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I find a hotel for late-night arrival?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Search near your arrival point, call two or three places to confirm they have a 24-hour reception, and share the address with someone you trust."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why are some places missing from the results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The data comes from map sources that may not list every business, and small or new places can be missing. Try a larger radius or a nearby landmark as the search area."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do nearby results need location permission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Near me uses your browser GPS. City search uses geocoding instead — no GPS needed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Nearby Hotels free on ContentVerse India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All India utility tools on ContentVerse India are free to use with no sign-up required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an official government website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. ContentVerse India is an independent platform. We use public datasets and open APIs. For official records, use government portals like Parivahan, GST, FoSCoS, or ECI."}}]}21:T79b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to use Nearby Hotels","description":"Finding a place to stay late at night or in an unfamiliar city can be stressful. This nearby hotels tool lists hotels, lodges and guest houses around any area or your current location, with addresses and map links. Use it to compare options near a railway station, bus stand, hospital or event venue ","url":"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hotels","totalTime":"PT5M","tool":{"@type":"HowToTool","name":"Nearby Hotels"},"step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"How to find hotels near you","text":"Enter the area where you need to stay, such as a station name or a landmark, or use your current location. Choose a radius and search. The results list nearby hotels with their address and a map link so you can judge distance from your destination."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"How to choose a hotel from the list","text":"Distance is only one factor. Check recent guest reviews on the booking site, confirm the room rate including taxes and ask what is included, such as breakfast, Wi-Fi and parking. A hotel slightly farther from the station but in a quieter lane may be a better choice."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Safety tips for travellers","text":"Prefer hotels with visible reception staff, CCTV in common areas and working locks. For solo or late-night arrivals, share the hotel address with a family member and keep your first night’s booking confirmed in advance. Pay only through official booking channels or the hotel’s verified payment methods."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Location, privacy and accuracy","text":"The tool asks for your location only when you press the “use my location” option, and your browser shows its own permission prompt. If you prefer not to share GPS, type an area or city instead; the search then uses geocoding and needs no permission."}]}16:[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Nearby Hotels\",\"alternateName\":\"Nearby Hotels Finder India\",\"description\":\"Find hotels and lodging near your location or any Indian city.\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hotels\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ContentVerse India\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-IN\",\"featureList\":\"How to find hotels near you, How to choose a hotel from the list, Safety tips for travellers, Location, privacy and accuracy\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$20"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"India Tools\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Nearby Hotels\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-hotels\"}]}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}]],"$L22"]
